      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "A5F7084293C6427A",
      "text": "Muchas gracias por echarnos un cable con las\\nteraincursiones.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "A5F7094293C6442D",
      "text": "Gracias a ti hemos podido continuar con nuestras\\ninvestigaciones, y hemos aprendido lo siguiente...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "A5F7024293C63848",
      "text": "De vez en cuando, del enorme foso de Paldea\\nsurgen brotes de energía Teracristal que tienen\\r\\nciertas repercusiones sobre los cristales que hay\\r\\nesparcidos por toda la región.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "A5F7034293C639FB",
      "text": "Parece que esta energía está teniendo un fuerte\\nefecto en uno de los cristales que conducen a las\\r\\nteraincursiones y se está transformando en un\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]cristal negro[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
