      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "A5F7044293C63BAE",
      "text": "El Pokémon Teracristal de su interior parece\\nextremadamente poderoso...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "A5F7054293C63D61",
      "text": "Un Entrenador de nivel medio mordería el polvo\\na la primera de cambio, con eso te lo digo todo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "A5F6FE4293C6317C",
      "text": "Temo que sea peligroso incluso para alguien tan\\nhábil como tú.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "A5F6FF4293C6332F",
      "text": "Así que, por mucho que su ubicación aparezca\\nen el mapa, ni se te ocurra ir a investigar el cristal\\r\\nnegro, ¿me has oído? Es demasiado peligroso.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_033_select_01",
      "hash64": "742C174E87DE7A19",
      "text": "¡Vale!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_033_select_02",
      "hash64": "742C144E87DE7500",
      "text": "Pero suena interesante...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "A5FA8C4293C9589D",
      "text": "Hmm... ¿Tú aceptando quedarte quietecit[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa?\\nNo sé yo si fiarme de tu respuesta...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "A5FA8B4293C956EA",
      "text": "Lo digo en serio. Esto no es una invitación a ir.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "A5FA8A4293C95537",
      "text": "Siento haberte pedido en primer lugar que nos\\nayudaras con las teraincursiones, pero esta en\\r\\nconcreto es demasiado peligrosa, así que me\\r\\nrepito: nada de acercarse al cristal negro.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 186,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_033_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "A5FA894293C95384",
      "text": "Espero que me hagas caso, ¡eh![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
